          "The host sets up Custom Game with the friends as HUMAN players, then starts the match."
        ],
        "keys": [
          { "key": "Arrows or W A S D", "does": "Move and jump." },
          { "key": "Z or T", "does": "Shoot." },
          { "key": "X or Y", "does": "Throw a grenade." }
